---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Sowing Kindness Society" description="Sowing Kindness Society is a Singapore-based non-profit promoting kindness in children, families and communities.">

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-header__crumbs"><span>About</span><span class="dot"></span><span>Who We Are</span></div>
    <h1 data-fade style="font:700 clamp(36px,5.5vw,72px)/1.06 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 18px">
      <span style="color:var(--ink-900)">Nurturing kindness in </span><span style="color:var(--forest-800)">children, families </span><span style="color:var(--orange-500)">and communities.</span>
    </h1>
    <p data-fade style="font:400 18px/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);max-width:660px;margin:0">
      Sowing Kindness Society is a Singapore-based non-profit promoting kindness, compassion and positive values through meaningful initiatives, family engagement and community activities.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Story -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top:64px">
  <div class="container grid-2col">
    <div data-fade class="blob-img-wrap" style="position:relative;width:110%;margin-left:-5%;aspect-ratio:1045/941;-webkit-mask-image:url(/illustrations/section-2-blob-mask.svg);mask-image:url(/illustrations/section-2-blob-mask.svg);-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-repeat:no-repeat">
      <img src="/illustrations/section-2-about.webp" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div data-stagger>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">01</span><span class="eyebrow__label">Our story</span></div>
      <h2 style="font:700 clamp(24px,4vw,52px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:18px 0 14px">
        <span style="color:var(--ink-900)">A small society </span><span style="color:var(--forest-800)">with a big </span><span style="color:var(--orange-500)">garden.</span>
      </h2>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.75 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin-bottom:14px">Sowing Kindness Society began as a small circle of parents, educators and storytellers who shared one belief: kindness is something we can grow in our youngest children, one moment, one story, one act at a time.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.75 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin-bottom:14px">From quiet picture-book afternoons in neighbourhood living rooms, we have grown into a bilingual movement that holds an annual storytelling competition for children aged 3 to 6, runs school collaborations across Singapore, and gathers families through gentle, joyful events.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.75 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0">We're still small. We still believe in slow, careful work — like a gardener tending a young seedling. Thank you for tending it with us.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MVV -->
<section class="section section--cream" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden">
  <!-- Decorative leaves -->
  <svg style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;opacity:.35;pointer-events:none" width="160" height="180" viewBox="0 0 160 180" fill="none">
    <path d="M20 160 C20 100 80 60 140 20" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
    {[[60,90],[40,110],[80,70],[100,50],[120,35]].map(([x,y]) => (
      <ellipse cx={x} cy={y} rx="14" ry="8" fill="#8FBE6C" opacity=".5" transform={`rotate(${-30+x/3} ${x} ${y})`}/>
    ))}
  </svg>
  <svg style="position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;opacity:.3;pointer-events:none;transform:scaleX(-1)" width="160" height="180" viewBox="0 0 160 180" fill="none">
    <path d="M20 160 C20 100 80 60 140 20" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
    {[[60,90],[40,110],[80,70],[100,50],[120,35]].map(([x,y]) => (
      <ellipse cx={x} cy={y} rx="14" ry="8" fill="#8FBE6C" opacity=".5" transform={`rotate(${-30+x/3} ${x} ${y})`}/>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;position:relative;z-index:1">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:8px" data-fade><span class="eyebrow__num">02</span><span class="eyebrow__label">Mission, vision &amp; values</span></div>
    <h2 data-fade style="font:700 clamp(28px,4.5vw,64px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:16px 0 16px">
      <span style="color:var(--ink-900)">What guides </span><span style="color:var(--forest-800)">everything </span><span style="color:var(--orange-500)">we do.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="heart-divider" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:52px" data-fade><span class="line" style="width:60px"></span><span style="color:var(--heart)">♥</span><span class="line" style="width:60px"></span></div>
    <div class="grid-3col" style="max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto" data-stagger>
      {[
        { title:'Mission', img:'/images/Mission.png',  body:'Cultivate kindness and positive character in children and families through stories, programmes and community.' },
        { title:'Vision',  img:'/images/Vision.png',   body:'A kinder Singapore where compassion grows in everyday life — in homes, in schools, on buses and in playgrounds.' },
        { title:'Values',  img:'/images/Values.png',   body:'Kindness, compassion, growth and community — the four seeds at the centre of every programme.' },
      ].map(c => (
        <div class="card" style="padding:36px 28px 32px;text-align:center;background:var(--paper)">
          <div style="width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:999px;margin:0 auto 24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.10)">
            <img src={c.img} alt={c.title} style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div style="font:700 28px var(--serif);color:var(--forest-800);margin-bottom:10px">{c.title}</div>
          <span style="color:var(--heart);font-size:18px">♥</span>
          <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:0">{c.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Team -->
<section class="section section--cream" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden">

  <!-- Dandelion decorations -->
  <!-- Full dandelion — top left -->
  <svg style="position:absolute;top:40px;left:3%;opacity:.18;animation:9s ease-in-out infinite alternate drift-b;pointer-events:none" width="80" height="100" viewBox="0 0 80 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <line x1="40" y1="100" x2="40" y2="40" stroke="#6BAA45" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    {[0,30,60,90,120,150,180,210,240,270,300,330].map((a,i) => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 40 40)`}>
        <line x1="40" y1="40" x2="40" y2="8" stroke="#6BAA45" stroke-width="1"/>
        <circle cx="40" cy="7" r="3" fill="#8FBE6C"/>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <!-- Full dandelion — top right -->
  <svg style="position:absolute;top:20px;right:4%;opacity:.15;animation:11s ease-in-out infinite alternate drift-a;pointer-events:none" width="60" height="80" viewBox="0 0 60 80" fill="none">
    <line x1="30" y1="80" x2="30" y2="30" stroke="#6BAA45" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    {[0,36,72,108,144,180,216,252,288,324].map((a) => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 30 30)`}>
        <line x1="30" y1="30" x2="30" y2="6" stroke="#6BAA45" stroke-width="1"/>
        <circle cx="30" cy="5" r="2.5" fill="#8FBE6C"/>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <!-- Scattered seeds -->
  <svg style="position:absolute;top:15%;left:8%;opacity:.22;animation:7s ease-in-out 1s infinite alternate drift-a;pointer-events:none" width="22" height="28" viewBox="0 0 22 28" fill="none">
    <line x1="11" y1="28" x2="11" y2="14" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1"/>
    {[0,45,90,135,180,225,270,315].map(a => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 11 14)`}><line x1="11" y1="14" x2="11" y2="6" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="11" cy="5" r="1.5" fill="#8FBE6C"/></g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <svg style="position:absolute;top:10%;right:10%;opacity:.2;animation:8s ease-in-out 2s infinite alternate drift-b;pointer-events:none" width="18" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 24" fill="none">
    <line x1="9" y1="24" x2="9" y2="12" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1"/>
    {[0,60,120,180,240,300].map(a => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 9 12)`}><line x1="9" y1="12" x2="9" y2="5" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="9" cy="4" r="1.5" fill="#8FBE6C"/></g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <svg style="position:absolute;bottom:20%;left:5%;opacity:.18;animation:10s ease-in-out 0.5s infinite alternate drift-a;pointer-events:none" width="16" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 20" fill="none">
    <line x1="8" y1="20" x2="8" y2="10" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1"/>
    {[0,72,144,216,288].map(a => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 8 10)`}><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="8" y2="4" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="8" cy="3" r="1.5" fill="#8FBE6C"/></g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <svg style="position:absolute;bottom:15%;right:7%;opacity:.2;animation:9s ease-in-out 1.5s infinite alternate drift-b;pointer-events:none" width="20" height="26" viewBox="0 0 20 26" fill="none">
    <line x1="10" y1="26" x2="10" y2="13" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width="1"/>
    {[0,45,90,135,180,225,270,315].map(a => (
      <g transform={`rotate(${a} 10 13)`}><line x1="10" y1="13" x2="10" y2="6" stroke="#8FBE6C" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="10" cy="5" r="1.5" fill="#8FBE6C"/></g>
    ))}
  </svg>

  <!-- Small heart floats -->
  <span class="float-heart hide-mobile" style="top:25%;left:1.5%;font-size:14px;opacity:.4">♥</span>
  <span class="float-heart hide-mobile" style="top:60%;right:2%;font-size:12px;opacity:.3;animation-delay:2s">♥</span>

  <div class="container">

    <!-- Centered header -->
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px;position:relative" data-fade>
      <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px"><span class="eyebrow__num">03</span><span class="eyebrow__label">The gardeners</span></div>
      <h2 style="font:700 clamp(28px,4.5vw,60px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:0">
        <span style="color:var(--ink-900)">A small team </span><span style="color:var(--forest-800)">tending </span><span style="color:var(--orange-500)">the garden.</span><span style="color:var(--heart);font-size:.7em"> ♥</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Team cards -->
    <div class="grid-3col" data-stagger>
      {[
        {
          name:'Celina Loh', role:'Founder',
          initials:'CL', img:'/images/Celina Loh.png',
          badgeBg:'var(--orange-100)', badgeFg:'var(--orange-600)', roleFg:'var(--orange-600)',
          desc:'The heart of Sowing Kindness Society, driven by a lifelong passion to nurture kindness in children, families and communities.',
        },
        {
          name:'Mandy Teoh', role:'Secretary',
          initials:'MT', img:'/images/Mandy Teoh.png',
          badgeBg:'var(--sage-200)', badgeFg:'var(--forest-800)', roleFg:'var(--forest-800)',
          desc:'Organised, thoughtful and always thinking ahead. She keeps our team connected and our initiatives running smoothly.',
        },
        {
          name:'Shaney Koh', role:'Treasurer',
          initials:'SK', img:'/images/Shaney Koh.png',
          badgeBg:'var(--orange-100)', badgeFg:'var(--orange-600)', roleFg:'var(--orange-600)',
          desc:'Detail-oriented and dependable. She ensures our resources are managed wisely so we can create greater impact together.',
        },
      ].map(p => (
        <div class="card" style="overflow:hidden;text-align:center;padding:0 0 28px">
          <!-- Photo -->
          <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:3/2.8;overflow:hidden">
            <img src={p.img} alt={p.name} style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;display:block" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <!-- Text content -->
          <div style="padding:32px 22px 0">
            <div style="font:700 24px var(--serif);color:var(--forest-800);margin-bottom:4px">{p.name}</div>
            <div style={`font:600 13px var(--sans);color:${p.roleFg};margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:.02em`}>{p.role}</div>
            <p style="font:400 14px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 18px">{p.desc}</p>
            <div class="heart-divider" style="justify-content:center"><span class="line" style="width:20px"></span><span style="color:var(--heart);font-size:12px">♥</span><span class="line" style="width:20px"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Additional members -->
    <div data-fade style="margin-top:32px;text-align:center">
      <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:999px;padding:14px 28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)">
        <div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--sage-200);color:var(--forest-800);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span style="font:600 15px var(--sans);color:var(--forest-800)">+ 10 dedicated members</span>
        <span style="color:var(--heart)">♥</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font:400 14px/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-500);margin:12px auto 0;max-width:480px">Each one quietly tending the garden — contributing their time, care and kindness to our community.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Unified purpose strip -->
    <div data-fade style="margin-top:48px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:24px;padding:36px 40px;display:flex;gap:36px;align-items:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)">
      <div style="width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--sage-200);color:var(--forest-800);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0">
        <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font:700 20px var(--serif);color:var(--forest-800);margin-bottom:8px">Different strengths, one shared purpose.</div>
        <p style="font:400 15px/1.65 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0;max-width:680px">Each of us brings unique gifts to the garden, but we are united by the belief that kindness — no matter how small — can take root in every heart. Together, we nurture these seeds through our programmes, partnerships and community outreach, growing a kinder and more compassionate Singapore. <span style="color:var(--heart)">♥</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Founder story -->
    <div data-fade style="max-width:760px;margin:48px auto 0;background:var(--paper);border-radius:24px;padding:44px 48px;text-align:left;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px">
        <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--orange-100);color:var(--orange-600);font:700 20px var(--serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0">CL</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font:700 18px var(--serif);color:var(--forest-800)">Celina Loh</div>
          <div style="font:500 13px var(--sans);color:var(--ink-500)">Founder, Sowing Kindness Society</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="heart-divider" style="margin-bottom:24px"><span class="line" style="width:32px"></span><span style="color:var(--heart)">♥</span><span class="line" style="width:32px"></span></div>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">Celina's understanding of kindness comes not from books but from life. For over two decades she worked, kept home, and cared — for her grandma, her father who lived to 98, and her mother through sixteen years of Alzheimer's. Her two children grew up beside her through all of it, watching quietly, learning without being taught.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">They have grown into kind, caring adults. That is the idea at the heart of Sowing Kindness Society — that kindness, when lived, is caught.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0">As the founder of Sowing Kindness Society, Celina is looking to spread more kindness in communities through various activities and outreach, with the goal of fostering a more caring and loving Singapore.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Shaney's story -->
    <div data-fade style="max-width:760px;margin:28px auto 0;background:var(--paper);border-radius:24px;padding:44px 48px;text-align:left;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px">
        <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--orange-100);color:var(--orange-600);font:700 20px var(--serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0">SK</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font:700 18px var(--serif);color:var(--forest-800)">Shaney Koh</div>
          <div style="font:500 13px var(--sans);color:var(--ink-500)">Treasurer, Sowing Kindness Society</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="heart-divider" style="margin-bottom:24px"><span class="line" style="width:32px"></span><span style="color:var(--heart)">♥</span><span class="line" style="width:32px"></span></div>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">Shaney's understanding of kindness comes not from grand ideals, but from the small moments of ordinary life.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">She comes from a modest family, works as a clerical professional, and serves as Treasurer of Sowing Kindness Society. Her grounded, everyday life has given her a deep appreciation for the most sincere kind of care — the kind that passes quietly between people.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">In her family, she has always believed in the importance of presence and gratitude. One small wish she holds is that as her children grow up, she will have more time to be with her parents — to be filial, to repay them for years of care. She believes that kindness often starts at home, passing silently from one generation to the next.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0 0 16px">Joining Sowing Kindness Society gives Shaney the chance to carry that belief into the wider community. She may be a quiet contributor behind the scenes, but she hopes that through her work, every act of kindness finds the support it needs — and that more warmth flows through the community.</p>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.8 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);margin:0">She believes that kindness is not about how great it is — only whether you are willing to begin.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="section section--cream" style="padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px">
  <div class="container grid-2col">
    <div data-fade>
      <h2 style="font:700 clamp(24px,4vw,52px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:0 0 16px">
        <span style="color:var(--ink-900)">Plant a seed </span><span style="color:var(--forest-800)">with us.</span>
      </h2>
      <p style="font:400 17px/1.7 var(--sans);color:var(--ink-700);max-width:460px;margin-bottom:22px">Whether you partner with us, help host an event, or simply share a story with the children in your life — there are many gentle ways to take part.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch <span class="chev">›</span></a>
        <a href="/competition/" class="btn btn-outline">View Competition</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-fade class="blob-img-wrap" style="position:relative;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;aspect-ratio:1/1;-webkit-mask-image:url(/illustrations/about-cta-blob.svg);mask-image:url(/illustrations/about-cta-blob.svg);-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-repeat:no-repeat">
      <img src="/illustrations/about-cta.webp" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
